  "goodToKnow": "Der Schacht is a shaft: der Aufzugsschacht (lift shaft), der Lüftungsschacht (ventilation shaft), and in mining, der Förderschacht. The Zeche Zollverein in Essen, once Europe's largest coal mine, with its famous Schacht XII winding tower, is now a UNESCO World Heritage Site and design centre. Don't confuse it with das Schach (chess). Plural: die Schächte."
